### Default URL
GET http://localhost:5000/

### Default API URL
GET http://localhost:5000/api/

### Register (public)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "alice@example.com",
    "password": "monMotDePasse123"
}

### Login (public) - nomme la requête pour réutiliser le token
# @name login
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "alice@example.com",
    "password": "monMotDePasse123"
}

### Récupère le token de la réponse du login
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### Get all contacts (protégé)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/contacts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get one contact (protégé)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/contacts/6adbc5576aaed70c9b395725
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Add contact (protégé)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/contacts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "name": "Isma",
    "age": 25
}

### Update contact (protégé)
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/contacts/6ad35f08620a3edbe5e2801f
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "name": "tasti",
    "age": 18
}

### Delete contact (protégé)
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/contacts/6adbc501750d0ea0f8a068db
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Sans token : doit renvoyer 401
GET http://localhost:5000/api/contacts